"A class definition, redefinition or removal the kernel or the VM refused (module 8e): a bad name, a shape the superclass does not allow, a method that does not compile against the new shape, a Process running a method of the class, instances or references left. The message says which and why."
Class {
	#name : #ClassDefinitionError,
	#superclass : #Error,
	#category : #'Kernel-Exceptions'
}
